      "answerEN": "<p>This answer can be found in the “<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://014gc.sharepoint.com/sites/ILMS-SIGA/Aidesmmoire%20%20Job%20Aids/Aide-mémoires%20en%20anglais%20-%20English%20Job%20Aids/Responsable%20(Gestionnaire%20et%20chef%20d%27équipe)%20-%20Manager%20(and%20Team%20Leader)_EN/(Responsable)%20Accéder%20aux%20données%20d’achèvement%20du%20curriculum%20de%20formation%20essentielle%20(CFE)%20de%20mon%20équipe%20–%20(Manager)%20Accessing%20my%20Team’s%20Essential%20Training%20Curriculum%20(ETC)%20Completion%20Data_EN.docx?d=w49119f07dc9f45ffa508ee5b06e2f9e4&amp;csf=1&amp;web=1&amp;e=4a28d5\">Accessing my Team’s Mandatory or Foundational Training Curriculum (MTC / FTC) Completion Data</a>” job aid.</p>",
