      "answerEN": "<p>To browse all job aids, please \"<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://014gc.sharepoint.com/sites/ILMS-SIGA/Aidesmmoire%20%20Job%20Aids/Forms/AllItems.aspx?ga=1&amp;viewid=96e8d7a4%2Dc6e2%2D4219%2Daa49%2Ddfd730e0a29d\">access our Sharepoint</a>\" and choose your preferred language, then the role associated with your question.</p><br><p> </p><br><p>Please note that we named our folders and documents following the <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.tbs-sct.canada.ca/pol/doc-eng.aspx?id=26164\">Directive on Official Languages for Communications and Services</a>, which indicates that French must appear first in our titles. Expand the “Name” column in SharePoint to view the English portion of longer file names.</p>",
